# Persona (Moshi) – optional handoff to agent-service
# When set, Persona POSTs { phone, transcript } to this URL when a voice session ends.
# Run agent-service separately and set this to its /handoff endpoint, e.g.:
#   HANDOFF_URL=https://your-agent-service.example.com/handoff
# The client must pass the user's phone as the `phone` query param on the WebSocket URL.
# HANDOFF_URL=
